WEBVTT

00:00:02.170 --> 00:00:05.560
You with holy wings, who are close to God...

00:00:05.560 --> 00:00:10.310
To think I'll be able to see Her Holiness 
accepted into the Holy Palace in my lifetime.

00:00:10.310 --> 00:00:15.760
When Her Holiness grows up, 
that is when we shall go to join God.

00:00:15.760 --> 00:00:21.360
She must be raised with great care within 
the Holy Palace, so that no harm befalls her.

00:00:21.810 --> 00:00:26.720
It's been decided! Today is a good day! 
The day of Saint Michellia!

00:00:26.720 --> 00:00:29.690
Let us forget our hatred and divisions,
 and share in the joy!

00:00:33.970 --> 00:00:36.230
Please, be quiet!

00:00:36.230 --> 00:00:38.390
Is this some punishment?

00:00:38.960 --> 00:00:40.970
He must be hidden.

00:00:40.970 --> 00:00:43.140
No one in the capital must know of him.

00:00:43.580 --> 00:00:45.620
Leave it to me.

00:00:45.620 --> 00:00:48.340
Are you okay with this?

00:00:48.340 --> 00:00:54.390
If the whole world is against him,
then I shall protect my little brother alone.

00:00:55.740 --> 00:00:57.520
Please, both of you, be safe.

00:00:58.080 --> 00:00:59.870
Take care of Ultos.

00:01:07.420 --> 00:01:08.420
Good morning.

00:01:08.700 --> 00:01:11.130
Why don't we eat breakfast?

00:01:12.980 --> 00:01:14.450
You're going already?

00:01:15.480 --> 00:01:17.350
The flock is leaving, huh?

00:01:18.180 --> 00:01:21.050
This is the perfect day to start a journey.

00:01:23.200 --> 00:01:25.240
You're trying to make me feel better?

00:01:25.240 --> 00:01:28.570
Don't worry. I have my brother.

00:01:28.950 --> 00:01:30.770
Go on, go.

00:01:30.770 --> 00:01:32.800
You'll be in big trouble if you 
get separated from the flock.

00:01:36.880 --> 00:01:40.620
Happy sixteenth birthday, Ultos.

00:01:41.730 --> 00:01:46.000
Today, again, the holy capital is still 
the most beautiful city in the world.

00:01:56.380 --> 00:01:59.220
<b>The Apathetic Boy and the Girl in a Bottle</b>

00:03:17.920 --> 00:03:21.880
<b>The Angel Who Couldn't Fly and the Holy Wings of Ten Thousand Prayers (Part 1)</b>

00:03:18.060 --> 00:03:23.870
Jamo, jamo, jamo, jamo!

00:03:23.870 --> 00:03:28.550
Jamo, jamo, jamo, ja...

00:03:29.410 --> 00:03:30.460
Jamo?

00:03:30.460 --> 00:03:31.970
Is that...?

00:03:34.050 --> 00:03:35.550
What's up?

00:03:37.150 --> 00:03:39.300
The Sky Country, jamo!

00:03:39.300 --> 00:03:42.630
Wow! How is a whole continent floating?

00:03:42.630 --> 00:03:44.870
No idea, jamo.

00:03:44.870 --> 00:03:47.570
Is that our next destination?

00:03:47.570 --> 00:03:51.990
No, you can't do any business 
in the Sky Country, jamo.

00:03:51.990 --> 00:03:54.620
There's no way to get up there, jamo.

00:03:54.620 --> 00:03:57.690
I guess it's too much even for you, Jamo.

00:03:57.690 --> 00:04:02.110
And we've already got plenty 
of things I've bought, jamo.

00:04:02.110 --> 00:04:05.270
I'm heading back to the kingdom, jamo.

00:04:05.270 --> 00:04:06.770
I see.

00:04:06.770 --> 00:04:08.300
The kingdom, huh?

00:04:08.300 --> 00:04:10.820
Maybe I'll go see Mom...

00:04:11.380 --> 00:04:13.200
Merc, in f-front of you!

00:04:13.940 --> 00:04:15.080
Jamo!

00:04:18.150 --> 00:04:21.210
You can't build a nest out of me!

00:04:21.720 --> 00:04:23.070
Merc!

00:04:26.560 --> 00:04:28.650
Merc! Are you okay?

00:04:28.650 --> 00:04:31.810
Yuu-san, thank you!

00:04:31.810 --> 00:04:32.710
But...

00:04:32.710 --> 00:04:37.430
You haven't saved me at <i>all</i>!

00:04:35.700 --> 00:04:38.840
I know!

00:04:40.930 --> 00:04:43.100
How far you think they're gonna go, jamo?

00:04:53.850 --> 00:04:56.060
Pestia-dono, get them out of here!

00:04:56.460 --> 00:04:58.500
Okay, Feyle-sama!

00:04:59.320 --> 00:05:00.010
Oh, no!

00:05:02.820 --> 00:05:04.000
Commander!

00:05:04.000 --> 00:05:05.370
Ravial-sama!

00:05:05.370 --> 00:05:07.550
Don't let go of your sword to pray.

00:05:07.550 --> 00:05:11.440
Our blades are a second set of wings,
given to us by God!

00:05:11.870 --> 00:05:14.530
Don't let the monsters take another 
step towards the Holy Palace.

00:05:14.530 --> 00:05:15.250
Right!

00:05:21.810 --> 00:05:22.530
Don't tell me...

00:05:26.520 --> 00:05:27.430
No!

00:05:27.430 --> 00:05:28.540
The Cloud Eater?

00:05:28.540 --> 00:05:30.890
I'll handle the Cloud Eater!

00:05:32.200 --> 00:05:34.050
That's crazy, Commander!

00:05:40.240 --> 00:05:41.700
Commander, the Cloud Eater...

00:05:50.170 --> 00:05:51.170
Commander!

00:05:51.170 --> 00:05:54.450
Now's our perfect chance to get those pests!

00:05:54.450 --> 00:05:56.160
Don't follow them.

00:05:56.160 --> 00:05:58.980
Our job is to protect the holy capital.

00:05:58.980 --> 00:06:01.340
But we don't know when they'll attack again—

00:06:06.720 --> 00:06:08.620
Ow...

00:06:08.620 --> 00:06:11.750
We survived, somehow.

00:06:17.120 --> 00:06:18.350
C-Commander!

00:06:18.350 --> 00:06:21.120
You can't touch groundlings!

00:06:21.120 --> 00:06:23.350
H-Hi!

00:06:23.350 --> 00:06:27.040
The sins of the earth will infect you 
and you'll lose the protection of God!

00:06:27.040 --> 00:06:28.230
Don't do it!

00:06:31.270 --> 00:06:33.380
Ow...

00:06:33.770 --> 00:06:36.960
You're the one who calmed 
the Cloud Eater, right?

00:06:37.780 --> 00:06:39.240
No...

00:06:39.240 --> 00:06:43.250
Thank you, healer boy.

00:06:43.250 --> 00:06:44.190
Healer?

00:06:44.190 --> 00:06:48.470
But groundlings are not allowed here.

00:06:48.470 --> 00:06:53.100
Uh, s-sorry. I didn't mean to come here.

00:06:53.100 --> 00:06:54.570
That's right!

00:06:54.570 --> 00:06:57.930
Mr. Graowns dropped us!

00:06:57.930 --> 00:06:59.670
Talking water?

00:06:59.670 --> 00:07:01.040
You're...!

00:07:01.510 --> 00:07:04.380
Are you the Blessing of Heaven?

00:07:04.820 --> 00:07:07.130
The Holy Water?

00:07:07.810 --> 00:07:09.230
Holy Water?

00:07:10.110 --> 00:07:14.210
Water is a holy blessing 
given to us by Heaven.

00:07:14.210 --> 00:07:16.490
Today is the day of Saint Michellia.

00:07:16.490 --> 00:07:22.800
God must have sent you here to free you 
from the tainted hands of the groundlings!

00:07:22.800 --> 00:07:24.710
The Holy Water?

00:07:24.710 --> 00:07:26.640
God has sent his servant!

00:07:26.640 --> 00:07:29.370
A messenger from God, sent to celebrate 
the day of Saint Michellia!

00:07:30.150 --> 00:07:33.000
Merc is... the Holy Water?

00:07:33.000 --> 00:07:37.670
If God sent you, we must take you 
to Her Holiness immediately!

00:07:37.670 --> 00:07:41.260
Wait! I'm not water!

00:07:41.260 --> 00:07:45.660
I don't even know what I am!

00:07:45.660 --> 00:07:49.190
So you have no memories from 
before God sent you here?

00:07:49.680 --> 00:07:51.430
That's a problem.

00:07:51.430 --> 00:07:57.160
I'm sure that Her Holiness would know 
what the Holy Water is.

00:07:57.160 --> 00:07:59.040
Um...

00:08:00.850 --> 00:08:03.460
You're so beautiful, though.

00:08:06.480 --> 00:08:09.470
Feyle, take the boy to the Isolated Island.

00:08:09.470 --> 00:08:10.140
Yes, sir.

00:08:11.000 --> 00:08:13.770
I'll take the Holy Water with me.

00:08:14.700 --> 00:08:17.220
Come this way.

00:08:18.810 --> 00:08:20.250
Yuu-san...

00:08:22.100 --> 00:08:23.840
We won't hurt you.

00:08:30.960 --> 00:08:32.800
Okay.

00:08:39.770 --> 00:08:44.340
I'll head to the Isolated Island first.
Bring the boy later.

00:08:44.340 --> 00:08:45.050
Yes, sir.

00:08:45.640 --> 00:08:46.920
Merc...

00:08:48.320 --> 00:08:49.810
Yuu-san...

00:08:55.670 --> 00:08:57.020
Yuck!

00:08:57.020 --> 00:08:59.930
It must be terrible to not have wings.

00:09:00.530 --> 00:09:01.530
What is this place?

00:09:01.530 --> 00:09:04.030
A place for housing criminals.

00:09:04.450 --> 00:09:07.120
It's never been used, it seems.

00:09:07.120 --> 00:09:08.930
Criminals?

00:09:09.480 --> 00:09:10.700
Well done.

00:09:11.720 --> 00:09:14.380
How'd you get here so fast?

00:09:14.380 --> 00:09:16.560
We have to speak to Her Holiness first.

00:09:16.560 --> 00:09:19.150
Then I'll talk to him some more.

00:09:19.150 --> 00:09:20.690
O-Okay!

00:09:21.210 --> 00:09:22.710
U-Um...

00:09:23.230 --> 00:09:24.320
Wait!

00:09:24.670 --> 00:09:25.780
What will happen to Merc?

00:09:26.470 --> 00:09:29.250
If Her Holiness accepts 
her as the Holy Water,

00:09:29.250 --> 00:09:32.030
you won't be able to be with her anymore.

00:09:32.580 --> 00:09:33.460
Feyle...

00:09:33.460 --> 00:09:35.950
I'm sorry. I just feel bad for him.

00:09:39.730 --> 00:09:44.910
If Merc really does have something to 
do with the Sky Country's God...

00:09:45.520 --> 00:09:48.150
No, even if she does, I...

00:09:50.810 --> 00:09:53.520
First, I have to figure out how to get out.

00:09:54.310 --> 00:09:56.590
Well, that's a surprise.

00:09:56.590 --> 00:09:59.810
You plan on getting out?

00:10:01.100 --> 00:10:03.140
You're my new roommate.

00:10:03.140 --> 00:10:04.490
Roommate?

00:10:04.860 --> 00:10:06.830
That's what my brother said.

00:10:06.830 --> 00:10:09.920
I'm sorry, but I have to leave.

00:10:10.240 --> 00:10:13.790
We can't fly, so we can't leave.

00:10:13.790 --> 00:10:17.500
"We"? You've got no wings!

00:10:17.500 --> 00:10:19.550
You just noticed?

00:10:19.550 --> 00:10:22.880
So the groundlings don't
 even have eyes to see?

00:10:23.280 --> 00:10:26.070
You're not one of the Sky People?

00:10:26.070 --> 00:10:29.050
You can see this halo, right?

00:10:29.050 --> 00:10:30.990
It's proof I'm one of the Sky People.

00:10:30.990 --> 00:10:32.120
So why?

00:10:32.710 --> 00:10:35.470
I've never had wings.

00:10:35.470 --> 00:10:37.900
I guess God forgot to put them on me.

00:10:38.960 --> 00:10:43.650
I don't know why you're here, but you'll 
probably remain a caged bird until you die.

00:10:43.650 --> 00:10:46.240
No, I'm leaving.

00:10:46.580 --> 00:10:48.700
I have to find my friend.

00:10:49.540 --> 00:10:51.200
You're serious?

00:10:51.200 --> 00:10:52.240
Yes.

00:10:55.220 --> 00:10:59.120
Then... can you take me with you?

00:11:04.990 --> 00:11:10.560
Holy Water, I'm sorry for 
shaking you on the way here.

00:11:10.560 --> 00:11:12.330
Are you okay?

00:11:12.330 --> 00:11:14.110
I'm okay.

00:11:14.110 --> 00:11:18.450
But I want you to send 
me back to be with Yuu-san.

00:11:18.450 --> 00:11:22.480
The groundlings are still criminals 
whom God has not forgiven.

00:11:22.480 --> 00:11:25.960
We cannot take you to be 
with someone like that.

00:11:25.960 --> 00:11:28.110
It's a misunderstanding!

00:11:28.110 --> 00:11:30.540
I'm sorry for the trouble.

00:11:30.540 --> 00:11:32.350
But don't worry!

00:11:32.350 --> 00:11:35.720
Her Holiness will help you!

00:11:37.150 --> 00:11:42.180
Fine. Then I'll meet this "Holiness" of yours.

00:11:42.180 --> 00:11:44.050
Thank you!

00:11:44.930 --> 00:11:46.550
Don't fall.

00:11:46.550 --> 00:11:49.030
Groundlings have poor eyesight.

00:11:49.030 --> 00:11:50.320
Here.

00:11:50.700 --> 00:11:52.200
A special service for you.

00:11:52.880 --> 00:11:54.160
Thank you.

00:11:54.640 --> 00:11:57.050
Wait, I haven't given you my name yet.

00:11:57.490 --> 00:11:58.670
I'm Yuu.

00:11:58.670 --> 00:12:00.030
I'm Ultos.

00:12:00.030 --> 00:12:04.310
Hey, stay at least a meter away from me.

00:12:04.700 --> 00:12:07.110
Or the sins of the groundlings will infect me.

00:12:09.750 --> 00:12:12.150
There are more people out today than usual.

00:12:12.150 --> 00:12:15.050
It's the day of Saint Somebody-or-Other.

00:12:15.050 --> 00:12:17.560
Saint Theatremia?

00:12:17.960 --> 00:12:22.520
I read in a history book that she was in 
the Holy Palace several centuries ago.

00:12:22.910 --> 00:12:26.770
I think it was an easier to pronounce name.

00:12:27.300 --> 00:12:30.170
The whole city looks like it's shining.

00:12:30.170 --> 00:12:34.550
On days with good weather, the light reflects
 off the wings of the people as they fly,

00:12:34.550 --> 00:12:37.140
and the holy capital seems to shine.

00:12:37.490 --> 00:12:42.750
I can only imagine how much fun 
it must be to fly with them.

00:12:43.550 --> 00:12:45.160
I think about that a lot.

00:12:46.210 --> 00:12:47.290
Let's do this.

00:12:48.130 --> 00:12:51.730
I'll help you find your friend.

00:12:51.730 --> 00:12:56.130
And in exchange, help me get wings.

00:12:56.130 --> 00:12:58.450
Okay. I will.

00:12:58.450 --> 00:13:00.340
It's a deal.

00:13:00.340 --> 00:13:02.830
So, where are they?

00:13:02.830 --> 00:13:03.980
I don't know.

00:13:04.770 --> 00:13:06.800
Then how do we get off the island?

00:13:06.800 --> 00:13:08.360
I'm about to think about that.

00:13:09.100 --> 00:13:11.120
That's fraud! Liar!

00:13:11.120 --> 00:13:13.160
This is the problem with you groundlings.

00:13:13.160 --> 00:13:15.360
I was sure you had a plan.

00:13:15.360 --> 00:13:17.020
How would I?

00:13:17.020 --> 00:13:18.570
I'm about to think about it.

00:13:25.870 --> 00:13:29.410
The area around the tower 
is traveled by monsters.

00:13:29.410 --> 00:13:32.770
There's a spell on it that keeps them away.

00:13:32.770 --> 00:13:35.110
But if you step out, you'll be a meal quick.

00:13:38.450 --> 00:13:39.380
Hey!

00:13:40.470 --> 00:13:42.440
The monster's coming this way!

00:13:42.440 --> 00:13:44.250
This is your fault!

00:13:54.420 --> 00:13:55.470
<i>Help us.</i>

00:14:09.070 --> 00:14:10.590
Hey!

00:14:11.840 --> 00:14:13.880
He's going to give us a ride.

00:14:13.880 --> 00:14:16.020
Was that healing?

00:14:16.020 --> 00:14:17.860
Are you a healer?

00:14:18.140 --> 00:14:19.480
Looking like that?

00:14:19.480 --> 00:14:21.390
You didn't need that last part.

00:14:27.380 --> 00:14:29.760
Hey, aren't we going?

00:14:31.050 --> 00:14:32.430
We are!

00:14:41.230 --> 00:14:44.770
<b>The Apathetic Boy and the Girl in a Bottle</b>

00:14:46.260 --> 00:14:48.780
This town is so full of life!

00:14:48.780 --> 00:14:52.270
Yes, today is the Day of Saint Michellia,
so it's especially lively!

00:14:52.270 --> 00:14:54.520
Is that a special day?

00:14:54.520 --> 00:14:58.380
It's a day to celebrate God sending 
Saint Michellia to the Holy Palace,

00:14:58.380 --> 00:15:00.160
and give prayers of thanks.

00:15:00.560 --> 00:15:03.960
Many pilgrims come every year.

00:15:05.540 --> 00:15:10.060
All the Sky People take each other's hands,
 forget their hatred and divisions,

00:15:10.060 --> 00:15:13.430
and rejoice with one another 
till the sun rises!

00:15:14.020 --> 00:15:15.770
Does that mean you, too?

00:15:16.180 --> 00:15:19.390
No, we serve Her Holiness.

00:15:19.390 --> 00:15:21.210
That sounds hard.

00:15:21.210 --> 00:15:23.960
Her Holiness is very kind.

00:15:23.960 --> 00:15:27.390
It's an honor to be near her.

00:15:27.390 --> 00:15:31.260
You really love her, don't you?

00:15:31.260 --> 00:15:33.110
I-I do not—

00:15:36.400 --> 00:15:37.920
I'm sorry!

00:15:38.280 --> 00:15:40.000
Her Holiness is close to God.

00:15:40.480 --> 00:15:43.660
It's only thanks to her 
kindness that someone

00:15:43.660 --> 00:15:47.840
with small wings, like me,
is allowed to serve her.

00:15:47.840 --> 00:15:48.800
Kindness?

00:15:48.800 --> 00:15:52.970
When I was still an ignorant child,

00:15:54.060 --> 00:15:58.960
I wandered into the spot where 
Her Holiness was purifying herself.

00:15:59.590 --> 00:16:02.640
Of course, I was captured quickly,

00:16:02.640 --> 00:16:07.890
but since I had sinned, Her Holiness 
saved me by letting me serve her.

00:16:09.910 --> 00:16:13.820
So it's not appropriate to look 
up to her like a big sister.

00:16:15.620 --> 00:16:17.540
Come on, let's go.

00:16:19.630 --> 00:16:22.880
Your Holiness, I've brought the Holy Water.

00:16:23.400 --> 00:16:24.800
Come in.

00:16:34.240 --> 00:16:36.470
Thanks. You were a huge help.

00:16:39.000 --> 00:16:42.890
Monsters are warmer and 
softer than I would've thought.

00:16:42.890 --> 00:16:46.150
How does it feel to go 
outside for the first time?

00:16:46.150 --> 00:16:47.370
Hmm...

00:16:48.650 --> 00:16:52.090
It would be wonderful if 
I wasn't with a groundling.

00:16:52.090 --> 00:16:53.060
What?

00:16:55.310 --> 00:16:58.020
So this is how grass feels.

00:16:58.020 --> 00:16:59.520
It's so wonderful.

00:16:59.520 --> 00:17:01.440
Not at all like stone!

00:17:02.470 --> 00:17:03.450
There are no walls!

00:17:05.910 --> 00:17:08.120
I can keep running forever!

00:17:08.120 --> 00:17:11.270
I see, so this is freedom!

00:17:09.160 --> 00:17:11.280
Hey, where are you going?

00:17:12.460 --> 00:17:13.970
Ow...

00:17:13.970 --> 00:17:16.310
Why don't you have shoes?

00:17:16.310 --> 00:17:18.920
Shoes? I don't own any.

00:17:21.230 --> 00:17:24.500
Let's go into town and buy 
some shoes. I'll carry you.

00:17:27.090 --> 00:17:28.130
Oh, right.

00:17:28.130 --> 00:17:29.890
You don't want me to touch you.

00:17:30.650 --> 00:17:33.500
I wouldn't mind if you weren't a groundling.

00:17:34.210 --> 00:17:36.820
I can't lose my halo, too.

00:17:37.820 --> 00:17:39.150
I see.

00:17:39.150 --> 00:17:41.950
Then just let me patch you 
up without touching you.

00:17:42.540 --> 00:17:44.800
You sure were quick to stick out your foot.

00:17:44.800 --> 00:17:46.610
I've never been hurt so badly.

00:17:46.610 --> 00:17:48.760
It's just a little cut on your foot.

00:17:48.760 --> 00:17:50.000
It's not that big a deal.

00:17:51.380 --> 00:17:53.720
Taste this pain, too, then!

00:17:53.720 --> 00:17:58.920
Trip! Trip! Trip! Trip!

00:17:55.400 --> 00:17:58.920
Don't put some weird spell
on me! Just stay still!

00:18:00.720 --> 00:18:06.560
<i>But I guess if you stay in that room all day,
 you don't have any chances to get hurt.</i>

00:18:18.340 --> 00:18:21.870
I'll be waiting outside your room.

00:18:24.820 --> 00:18:26.300
Holy Water...

00:18:26.300 --> 00:18:30.310
No, your name is Merc-san, right?

00:18:31.540 --> 00:18:33.090
Yes.

00:18:33.430 --> 00:18:35.390
I am Michellia.

00:18:35.390 --> 00:18:38.950
Forgive me for remaining on this dais.

00:18:39.450 --> 00:18:43.210
I lack the power to flap these heavy wings,

00:18:43.210 --> 00:18:44.900
so I cannot fly.

00:18:44.900 --> 00:18:49.840
And it's difficult for me to walk or 
even stand unassisted for long.

00:18:51.460 --> 00:18:56.200
Your Holiness, there's little
 I can do on my own, too.

00:18:56.640 --> 00:18:59.910
Call me Michellia.

00:18:59.910 --> 00:19:02.660
Th-Thank you.

00:19:02.660 --> 00:19:05.000
What's wrong, Merc-san?

00:19:05.700 --> 00:19:10.400
Am I really this country's Holy Water?

00:19:10.400 --> 00:19:11.570
I'm sorry.

00:19:12.200 --> 00:19:15.740
I'm afraid I don't know.

00:19:16.520 --> 00:19:19.370
But they said you'd know!

00:19:19.370 --> 00:19:21.340
I'm truly sorry.

00:19:22.740 --> 00:19:26.840
Is the Yuu-san you spoke of your friend?

00:19:26.840 --> 00:19:28.530
Yes.

00:19:28.930 --> 00:19:32.600
I don't have any memories 
from before I met him.

00:19:32.890 --> 00:19:35.550
And to get my memories back,

00:19:35.550 --> 00:19:41.320
Yuu-san left on a journey,
 even though he hates monsters.

00:19:42.030 --> 00:19:45.650
Please, help him!

00:19:48.030 --> 00:19:52.010
You really do care about
 your friend, don't you?

00:19:52.450 --> 00:19:56.340
I want to hear more of your travels.

00:19:56.950 --> 00:20:02.460
Merc-san, may I meet this Yuu-san?

00:20:02.980 --> 00:20:05.100
I want to know.

00:20:05.100 --> 00:20:12.970
It must be the will of God that 
led you from the earth to here.

00:20:13.900 --> 00:20:14.900
And...

00:20:14.900 --> 00:20:17.510
Your Holiness, Ravial-sama is here.

00:20:20.030 --> 00:20:22.980
Your Holiness, I've come 
to report something.

00:20:23.390 --> 00:20:24.980
Good timing.

00:20:24.980 --> 00:20:29.320
Ravial, I'm told you sent the 
groundling to the Isolated Island.

00:20:29.320 --> 00:20:30.430
Yes.

00:20:30.430 --> 00:20:34.980
I'm sorry, but I want you to bring him here.

00:20:35.740 --> 00:20:37.540
You're sure?

00:20:37.540 --> 00:20:38.440
Yes.

00:20:38.440 --> 00:20:40.870
Very well. It will be done.

00:20:40.870 --> 00:20:42.250
W-Wait!

00:20:42.520 --> 00:20:44.660
I-I'm sorry.

00:20:44.660 --> 00:20:47.970
It's not my place to speak.

00:20:48.480 --> 00:20:50.310
But you're a holy being,

00:20:50.310 --> 00:20:53.560
and you must remain separated from 
the sins of the groundlings.

00:20:53.910 --> 00:20:57.350
Or God may take your wings!

00:20:57.350 --> 00:20:59.180
That's why.

00:20:59.860 --> 00:21:02.560
I want to know.

00:21:05.040 --> 00:21:06.060
I will return.

00:21:10.100 --> 00:21:13.630
Y-Your Holiness, it's time 
to bless the people.

00:21:14.220 --> 00:21:15.630
Very well.

00:21:16.790 --> 00:21:18.370
There's nothing to worry about.

00:21:18.370 --> 00:21:24.340
Ravial won't mistreat your friend 
just because he's a groundling.

00:21:25.150 --> 00:21:29.800
He and I share the same secret.

00:21:32.700 --> 00:21:34.100
Yuu-san...

00:21:36.100 --> 00:21:40.890
I can't believe Her Holiness 
wanted to meet a groundling.

00:21:41.980 --> 00:21:44.300
<i>But now is the perfect time.</i>

00:21:45.560 --> 00:21:47.860
<i>Please, don't get any ideas...</i>

00:21:50.320 --> 00:21:51.900
<i>My little brother.</i>

00:23:25.530 --> 00:23:26.590
It's me, Titi!

00:23:26.590 --> 00:23:27.240
It's me, Chacha!

00:23:27.240 --> 00:23:31.540
Yuu-kun and Merc-chan were separated!
 I'm so worried!

00:23:31.540 --> 00:23:34.140
What does Michellia-san mean when
she talks about the will of God?

00:23:34.140 --> 00:23:34.960
Next time,

00:23:34.300 --> 00:23:39.930
<b>The Angel Who Couldn't Fly and the Holy Wings of Ten Thousand Prayers (Part 2)</b>

00:23:34.960 --> 00:23:37.780
"The Angel Who Couldn't Fly and the Holy 
Wings of Ten Thousand Prayers," Part 2!

00:23:37.780 --> 00:23:40.390
I can't wait till next week!
